flowchart TB
  classDef person fill:#3a2e21,stroke:#ffbf75,color:#fff4e4;
  classDef container fill:#1e2942,stroke:#90a8ff,color:#edf2ff;
  classDef datastore fill:#1f2f2d,stroke:#83d5c1,color:#e9fff9;
  classDef external fill:#2d2435,stroke:#d5a6ff,color:#f9efff;

  U[Person: Usuario]:::person
  ADM[Person: Operador/DevOps]:::person

  subgraph SYS[System Boundary: FIAPX Video Processor]
    FE[Container: Frontend React
    Responsabilidade: autenticacao, upload, monitoracao e download]:::container

    API[Container: API NestJS
    Responsabilidade: auth JWT, endpoints, persistencia e enqueue]:::container

    WK[Container: Worker NestJS
    Responsabilidade: consumir fila, transcodificar, notificar]:::container

    DB[(Container: PostgreSQL
    users, video_jobs, notifications, password_reset_tokens)]:::datastore

    RQ[(Container: Redis/Bull
    fila video-processing)]:::datastore

    FS[(Container: File Storage
    uploads e outputs)]:::datastore
  end

  SMTP[External: SMTP Provider / MailHog]:::external
  DD[External: Datadog]:::external
  PROM[External: Prometheus]:::external
  GRAF[External: Grafana]:::external
  GHCR[External: GHCR Registry]:::external
  K8S[External: Kubernetes Cluster]:::external

  U -->|HTTPS| FE
  FE -->|REST JSON + Bearer JWT| API

  API -->|CRUD entities| DB
  API -->|publish jobs| RQ
  API -->|store uploaded file| FS

  WK -->|consume jobs| RQ
  WK -->|update status/progress| DB
  WK -->|read input / write output| FS
  WK -->|send completion email| SMTP

  API -. traces/logs .-> DD
  WK -. traces/logs .-> DD
  API -. metrics .-> PROM
  WK -. metrics .-> PROM
  PROM --> GRAF

  ADM -->|build/push image| GHCR
  ADM -->|deploy manifests| K8S
  K8S -->|run pods api/worker| API
  K8S -->|run pods api/worker| WK
